        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock 810871D, Dummy Montego Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe oval mounts of this DoralLock made dummy cylinder entry set paired with the delicate curved handle will not disappoint those looking for a classic that can withstand the ever changing fashions of today's world with undeniable elegance. The Montego Dummy Handleset comes with your choice of inside handle style. A dummy handleset, it neither locks nor latches; and it is most often used as a pull or to match trim on the inactive side of double doors. Choose from 8 different knobs or levers for the inside trim.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: matching <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-montego-handleset-dorallock-810871\">Montego Single Cylinder Handleset</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Oval Handover Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 11-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height Center to Center: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>False Deadbolt Plate Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>False Deadbolt Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Plate Height: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Plate Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-810871D-specifications.pdf?v=1704262206\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock Montego Dummy Cylinder Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/door-handing-picture.gif?v=1704352978\" border=\"0\" width=\"410\" height=\"150\" alt=\"door handing - left or right handed lever\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim finish will match the exterior handleset finish that you choose.</i>\r\n</p>",
